Description: Bound sensor enable waits and preserve open and close errors
 The QMI response only confirms delivery. A sensor may not send a
 configuration or measurement report, so give a pending enable a
 deadline. Dispatch completion in the caller's main context without
 polling, tear down listeners, and ignore late transport callbacks.
 The derived callbacks include Felix Niederer's upstream GError fixes
 f54187cd601260415b47efba7fc2985d28c3e810 and
 f6dfbfa5f34ef22f3d47ef346c22834e79c60df1.
Origin: other
Forwarded: no
---
